  "html": "\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Let's Come Together for the Relay Race of Love!</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Since 2018, we have had the support of many Youth volunteers in our various activities. And today, Youth Volunteers remain invaluable in helping community .</p><p>We warmly welcome you to do your part in our community service. Carry forward your own strengths in social practice and be a better youth.</p><p>Please contact us for more information!</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCJLlawoLRMB3TEXyhAji8YQ\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tYoutube\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"row cols-3\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2022/10/IMG_2248.jpg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2022/10/IMG_2223.jpg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2021/10/IMG_1261.jpg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"row cols-3\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Graphic Design</h3>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>This opportunity mainly includes color page design for event projects, graphic picture design, image post-production, video planning and design. Organize and process promotional video materials.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Multi-Lingual Language Assistance</h3>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>This opportunity mainly includes translation, guidance, free clinic reception and navigation, and on-site coordination and scheduling of community hiking.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>On-Site Assistance</h3>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Including, but not limited to, initial preparation of the project, distribution of leaflets, construction of event venue, maintenance of event site, provision of basic materials, maintenance of basic equipment, etc.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"row cols-3\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">Join Us</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">Join Us</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">Join Us</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></section>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row cols-9\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>PO Box 2422,&nbsp;</b><b>Matthews, NC 28106</b></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>+1 704-839-9583</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>ollietreefoundation@gmail.com</strong></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Copyright © 2024 OllieTree Foundation</strong></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n"
